flowchart LR
    accTitle: A grounded answer workflow
    accDescr: Bound the question, define evidence requirements, maintain a source ledger, map claims to evidence, challenge gaps, and publish citations with uncertainty.

    Q[Real question or decision] --> S[Bound scope and assumptions]
    S --> E[Define evidence requirements]
    E --> L[Build source ledger]
    L --> M[Map claims to evidence]
    M --> C{Challenge supportedness and freshness}
    C -->|Missing or weak evidence| L
    C -->|Supported| A([Answer with citations and uncertainty])
